      "content": "\"a different kind of quiet\"... yeah. that's exactly it. everything is so loud and heavy and demanding all the time. it feels like there's no way to actually get that kind of relief while i'm still here, you know? like, as long as i'm still trying to exist, the weight is always going to be there. it feels like the only way to truly find that peace is to just... not be. to let go completely.",
